        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Kwikset 800HE, Traditional Hawthorne Single Cylinder Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Kwikset made Hawthorne Handleset is both elegant and timeless. What is best about this handleset is that the decorative grip will never go out of style; a simple classic, it will look beautiful for years. The simple handle features square mounts. This handleset is made out of solid brass construction. The single cylinder 800HE Door Entry Set is operated by key outside and a turn knob inside. It is backed by a lifetime mechanical and finish warranty. Good for 1-3/4\" thick doors with 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Handleset:</b> the latchbolt is operated by a thumbpiece outside and grip inside. The deadbolt is operated by a key outside and a thumbturn inside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching: \r\n\r\n<a href=\"/products/hawthorne-dummy-cylinder-handleset-kwikset-802he\"><b>Hawthorne Dummy Handleset</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for the Hawthorne Single Cylinder Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>ANSI/BHMA A156.5 Grade 1 Deadbolt</li>\r\n<li> SmartKey cylinder.</li>\r\n<li>Bump-resistant deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Anti-pry shield.</li>\r\n<li>Polymer coating.</li>\r\n<li>Solid forged brass with solid brass construction.</li>\r\n<li>Easy installation.</li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacture Lifetime Mechanical & Finish Warranty.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 800HE Hawthorne Door Entry Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Length Overall: 17-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Projection: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Length: 13-2/5\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt to Latch Spacing: 5-1/2\" center to center</li>\r\n<li>Center of Latch to Center of Throughbolt:  8-13/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Cross Bore: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable backset for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" doors.</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Handing: please specify</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis handleset is customisable with a huge selection of interior trim knobs and levers and additional finish color options just <a href=\"/pages/contact\">contact us</a> for all the options! \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The inside trim will match the outside handleset's finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Hawthorne Single Cylinder Handleset, Kwikset 800HE",
                "description": "Kwikset 800HE Hawthorne Single Cylinder Handleset - This Kwikset made Hawthorne Handleset is both elegant and timeless. What is best about this handleset is that the decorative grip will never go out of style; a simple classic, it will look beautiful for years. The simple handle features square mounts. This handleset is made out of solid brass construction. The single cylinder 800HE Door Entry Set is operated by key outside and a turn knob inside. It is backed by a lifetime mechanical and finish warranty. Good for 1-3/4 inch thick doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.",
                "keywords": "KWI-800he, 800he single cylinder hawthorne handle sets, hawthorne handlesets, kwikset signature series, kwikset, handlesets, keyed handlesets, front door locks, deadbolt locksets, key locksets, single cylinder handlesets, 800he single cylinder handle sets, Kwikset 800 he handlesets, traditional handleseets, two piece handlesets,"
